The Eye has many powers, most of which will still work.  Obviously the
game isn't going to let you levelport to DL 1 as soon as you get the
Amulet, or you'd be skipping quite a bit of "fun."  Indeed, you can't
move between levels in any other manner than by stairs/ladders or
cursed potions of Gain Level, as far as I know.  However, the Eye
remains functional in all other respects, including conferring energy
regeneration (!), half spell damage, and magic resistance (plus ESP if
you wore it).

